sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Clock
    participant U as Universe / Clock.Listener
    participant B as outermostCell
    participant S as Statistics
    participant P as StatisticsPanel
    C->>U: tick()
    U->>B: figureNextState(...)
    U->>U: before = liveCells()
    Note over U,B: 기존 프리즈 고정 처리 후 전이
    U->>B: transition()
    U->>U: generation++
    Note over U,B: 기존 프리즈 만료 처리 완료
    U->>U: notifyBoardChanged(GENERATION, before)
    U->>U: createBoardChangeEvent(kind, before)
    U->>S: onBoardChanged(event)
    S->>S: calculate(event)
    S->>S: currentSummary = summary
    S->>P: showStatistics(summary) via Consumer.accept
    U->>U: refreshNow() when needed
